  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/P1660395.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(71 fotos) Pocs minuts despr&eacute;s de les 20 hores d&#39;aquest divendres s&#39;ha llan&ccedil;at des del balc&oacute; de l&#39;Ajuntament de Tales el coet que marca l&#39;inici de les festes d&#39;agost, que duraran fins diumenge 27. Despr&eacute;s s&#39;ha fet el cercavila pels carrers del centre hist&ograve;ric.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xupinassofestesagosttales17/p1660318.jpg\" alt=\"p1660318\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xupinassofestesagosttales17/p1660319.jpg\" alt=\"p1660319\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xupinassofestesagosttales17/p1660320.jpg\" alt=\"p1660320\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xupinassofestesagosttales17/p1660321.jpg\" alt=\"p1660321\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xupinassofestesagosttales17/p1660322.jpg\" alt=\"p1660322\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xupinassofestesagosttales17/p1660323.jpg\" alt=\"p1660323\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xupinassofestesagosttales17/p1660324.jpg\" alt=\"p1660324\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xupinassofestesagosttales17/p1660326.jpg\" alt=\"p1660326\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xupinassofestesagosttales17/p1660327.jpg\" alt=\"p1660327\